{"version":1,"content":"<p>隨着蘋果首款摺疊屏手機iPhone Duo即將於10月23日正式開售，蘋果日前向消費者發出提醒，由於預售需求遠超預期，發售首日提供給現場到店消費者的庫存數量將十分有限，相關機型預計會在短時間內售罄。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583288.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:41.973852+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:52:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"8806d6d00e29c7d56f91ef197401db17d0676b23d9e96392c2bc2ce8e278c563","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}